id: slot-symlink-standard-applied
category: slot-symlink
images: rs-oracle9
targets: rhel9
key: kernel.randomize_va_space
xfail_issue: 
comment: the standard distro 99-sysctl.conf -> ../sysctl.conf symlink present and correct: systemd-sysctl applies /etc/sysctl.conf at the 99 slot. Both RuleSteward and the real oracle apply kernel.randomize_va_space=0.
